    {
      "id": "p0164-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because this line plays with vagueness and expectations, and because Toby didn't mention this line in his translation notes, a rushed translator or an automated translator would've almost certainly mistranslated it as \"it costs three gold to ride the ferry\". Fortunately, Underta/e's localization team did recognize the joke and was able to properly preserve it in the Japanese script.",
        "raw": "Because this line plays with vagueness and expectations, and because Toby\ndidn't mention this line in his translation notes, a rushed translator or an\nautomated translator would've almost certainly mistranslated it as \"it costs\nthree gold to ride the ferry\". Fortunately, Underta/e's localization team did\nrecognize the joke and was able to properly preserve it in the Japanese script.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29563037,
          0.36640714,
          0.89308329,
          0.45012857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29072568,
          0.36569286,
          0.91304947,
          0.4512
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25,
          26
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这句话靠含糊措辞与预期落差制造笑点，Toby 又没有专门作注释，因此匆忙赶工的译者或自动翻译几乎一定会误译成“渡河要花三个金币”。幸运的是，Undertale 的本地化团队看出了笑话，并在日文剧本中妥善保留。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 70,
            "end": 79,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
