    {
      "id": "p0164-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Papyrus struggles with Napstablook's name and calls the character \"Napper Hog\". He corrupts Napstablook's name in a similar way in Japanese, resulting in the name Nappa Buu. The translator noted that this wasn't intentional at first, but both \"Nappa\" and \"Buu\" are characters from the Dragon Ball Z series.",
        "raw": "Papyrus struggles with Napstablook's name and calls the character \"Napper\nHog\". He corrupts Napstablook's name in a similar way in Japanese, resulting\nin the name Nappa Buu. The translator noted that this wasn't intentional at\nfirst, but both \"Nappa\" and \"Buu\" are characters from the Dragon Ball Z series.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29646826,
          0.63145,
          0.90366925,
          0.69864286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29072568,
          0.63073571,
          0.91304947,
          0.69971429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          39,
          40,
          41,
          42
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Papyrus 记不住 Napstablook 的名字，管这个角色叫“Napper Hog”（打盹猪）。日语里也有类似的叫错，结果变成了 Nappa Buu。译者指出，最初并不是有意为之，但“Nappa”（那巴）与“Buu”（布欧）恰好都是《龙珠 Z》的角色。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
